I forgot to add that there is an alternative to that with no new
cmavo, and already grammatical:

 .i lo se ka mi na nelci cu pu noroi se viska

"ka" doesn't really have a defined x2 place, so "se ka" could be a bit
vague, but I think the most likely candidate for something associated
with a property is something with that property.

